### Next Steps for the User
The Python 3.11 runtime environment is now correctly built and fully isolated. However, Windows Defender Application Control (WDAC) or a local IT AppLocker policy is currently blocking the compiled `c10.dll` library required by PyTorch/Ultralytics. You will need to either whitelist the `D:\AI ML Project\backend\venv` directory in your Windows security settings or reach out to your system administrator to adjust the Application Control policy.
